{"id": "86139", "name": "פתיחת סוגריים בחזקה – (v·a²·b)^n (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Write the follwing expression, \\(\\left( {{CT:0}}\\cdot {{CT:1}}\\cdot {{CT:2}} \\right)^{{CT:3}}\\), without brackets. <br /> <br /> [[input:ans]] [[validation:ans]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Remember that \\[ \\left({a}\\cdot{b}\\cdot{c} \\right)^n = {a^n}\\cdot{b^n}\\cdot{c^n}. \\] Therefore in this example: \\[ \\left({{CT:0}}\\cdot {{CT:1}}\\cdot {{CT:2}} \\right)^{{CT:3}} = {{{CT:0}}^{{CT:3}}}\\cdot{{{CT:4}}^{{{CT:5}}\\cdot {{CT:3}}}}\\cdot{{{CT:2}}^{{CT:3}}} = {{CT:6}}\\cdot{{CT:7}}\\cdot{{CT:8}}. \\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "simp", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "v*a^(2*n)*b^n", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": "<p>Don't forget when you are removing brackets from these types of expression to raise the constant to the power as well as the variable!</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["n", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 14}